<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Nintendo licensing deals.</title>
<headline>EU clears Nintendo licensing deals.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it had cleared new licensing agreements that video-game company Nintendo awards to firms that develop games that are compatible with its consoles.</p>
<p>The European Union executive said the agreements were compatible with EU competition law.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
